-- Even more memes, collected from Know Your Meme (knowyourmeme.com), 200 in this file.
-- The year comes from each entry. The country is the entry's region, or the country the meme
-- clearly comes from (a show, a person), else "Internet" (code ZZ): it has no single country.
-- The descriptions are written for this project.
-- Status rule: 2025 and later "trend", 2016-2024 "classic", earlier "outdated".
-- Runs on every start and adds only memes whose titles are not in the table yet.
ON CONFLICT (title) DO NOTHING;
